        "note": "Poetic use of 'payana' (journey)."
      },
      {
        "region": "Uttara Karnataka (Hubballi-Dharwad)",
        "phrase_kannada": "ಯತ್ತ ಕಡಿಕ ಹೊಂಟಿನ್ರಿ?",
